      "message": "Binder can be null if mmd is not ready yet (though I think it is very rare bacause mmd starts as soon as boot_completed and first zram maintenance is 1 hour after).\n\nAlso if mmd restarts, binder is null until mmd re-expose its Binder API. So I think we should reschedule the job 1 hour after (by default).\n\nBut indeed, it may be good idea to stop rescheduling if it fails to get binder multiple time in a row. If you think we need the counter for null binder, I will do it in another CL.",
